.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ---- OS ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---- Claude Code (keep shared project config, ignore local overrides) ----
.claude/settings.local.json

# ---- Planning / research notes (local, not tracked) ----
# docs/* rather than docs/ — git will not descend into an excluded directory, so the
# negations below only work if the exclusion is on the contents, not the directory itself.
docs/*
# Tracked exceptions: decision records, and the frozen reference material harvested from
# the retired base pipeline (ADR-0007) — the source repo may be deleted, so this is the backup.
!docs/adr/
!docs/harvest/
# CLAUDE.md is tracked and points at all three of these, so a clone without them gets project
# instructions referencing files that are not there — the same shape as the G0 records, which sat
# untracked under runs/ until 2026-08-06.
!docs/agents/

# ---- Teaching workspace (/teach skill — local study materials, not tracked) ----
teach/

# ---- Annotation build products (regenerated from a records file + the seed) ----
# The forms are ~1 MB of embedded task JSON each and `keyfile.jsonl` de-blinds them, so neither
# belongs in git. What is irreplaceable is what comes *back*: an annotator's exported labels go
# to docs/harvest/annotation/, which the `!docs/harvest/**/*.jsonl` rule above already tracks.
annotation/
